  m_Name: Carta_ZonaDeProcessamentoDeExportacao
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Zona de Processamento de Exporta\xE7\xE3o"
  _titleEn: Export Processing Zone
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Zonas com impostos reduzidos atraem f\xE1bricas que produzem para exportar
    ou para o mercado nacional."
  _summaryEn: Zones with reduced taxes attract factories that produce for export
    or for the domestic market.
  _realWorld: "A Zona Franca de Manaus, criada pelo Decreto-Lei 288 de 1967, formou
    o Polo Industrial de Manaus, com f\xE1bricas de eletr\xF4nicos e motocicletas."
  _realWorldEn: The Manaus Free Trade Zone, created by Decree-Law 288 of 1967, gave
    rise to the Manaus Industrial Hub, with electronics and motorcycle factories.
  _tradeOffs: "A ren\xFAncia de impostos tem custo para todo o pa\xEDs, e as empresas
    podem ir embora quando o incentivo acaba."
  _tradeOffsEn: Tax breaks have a cost for the whole country, and companies may leave
    when the incentive ends.
  _sources:
  - Label: "Zona Franca de Manaus (Wikip\xE9dia)"
    Url: https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zona_Franca_de_Manaus
  - Label: Decreto-Lei 288/1967 (Planalto)
    Url: https://www.planalto.gov.br/ccivil_03/decreto-lei/del0288.htm
